      "html": "<ul><li>A safeguarding audit checks that concerns are spotted, referred, logged and followed up.</li><li>The law differs by nation. England has the Care Act 2014. Scotland has the Adult Support and Protection (Scotland) Act 2007.</li><li>Deprivation of liberty needs an authorisation in date.</li><li>Training must be current, including bank and agency staff.</li><li>Quickler audits the system. It holds no case detail.</li></ul>"
