      "html": "<p>Deprivation of liberty. If a resident is under constant supervision and not free to leave, the home needs the right authorisation in date. In England that is DoLS. Scotland has its own rules. The audit checks each is current.</p><p>Training. It must be current for everyone, including bank and agency staff. And staff must know what to do.</p>"
